Before starting implementation I want to clarify any ambiguities and formalize goals in a new phased process document which can be used to farm out and track process for parallel tracks. We will have a prioritized set of features starting with the most basic end-to-end implementation and work down from that.\
I will provide a Claude token to use in the root directory.\
I want all of the parrallizable tracks identified and farmed out to Sonnet subagents with very clear tasks. Shared boundaries should be defined before starting when needed.\
Subagent work will be done on worktrees, separate branches, summary of changes, reviewed by us before merging. \
